iv>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"careerhealthsection\">\n        <div class=\"careercontainer\">\n          <div class=\"inner-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"career-title-wrap\">\n              <div class=\"inner-title-wrap center\">\n                <div data-w-id=\"3944909b-e0ad-78c1-c686-c3f0edeb14f5\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"inner-title-box\">\n                  <h2 class=\"inner-title inner-title-size\">Built on values. <span class=\"text-span-4\">Powered by people.</span></h2>\n                </div>\n                <div data-w-id=\"3944909b-e0ad-78c1-c686-c3f0edeb14fa\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"inner-description-box max-with\">\n                  <p class=\"optimize-description\">At Axle, our values aren’t just principles—they’re how we work, build, and show up every day. Here’s what drives us forward, together.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer gridcontainer w-container\">\n            <div class=\"w-layout-grid secondgrid\">\n              <div>\n                <div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68250c333ddd8f411088a89b/6851ebc9bdc6e32d766a0bba_search-icon.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" alt=\"\" class=\"c-icon\" />\n                  <h4 class=\"careerh4\">We seek the truth</h4>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"description\">We ask hard questions, challenge assumptions, and stay open to new perspectives - because solving big problems starts with honest thinking.</div>\n                <div class=\"hrline\"></div>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68250c333ddd8f411088a89b/6851ece70d45c867d9364479_corner.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" alt=\"\" class=\"c-icon\" />\n                  <h4 class=\"careerh4\">We win by working together</h4>\n           